# TiKV transactions study rows for brain18 (tikv study (owner 2026-11-10), INTERFACE.md rev of 2026-11-09 21:10; plan/case-studies/tikv/STAGING.md). No time limit: .cinf = 8640000 s.
# Programs: S_dt = benchmarks/tikv-txn-tla (Astra r4 ACCEPTED), Rust transliteration = benchmarks/tikv-txn-rust (approved r2 + Q5), Java port = benchmarks-cf/tikv-txn (javaout cf-tikv-txn, approved r2).
# Exports first (biggest first), then the merge joins; every join's two exports are in this file, so no imports. Java exports run without --split (single JVM, -Xmx32g); Java rows for every instance: the held Java rows were moved in after round 3 of the port (owner decision 2026-11-10 08:40: main spawns the shard tasks; Astra review of round 3 pending).
# C3J and XJ1: reference S_dt, candidate the port; XC1: reference Java, candidate Rust; XC2: the reverse. Variants f1 (A3), f2 (L1, X2r) per INTERFACE.md section 10.
# Split 2026-11-10 (coordinator, decision (b)): the 16 JMC rows of brain18.rows (4 XCE, 4 XJ1, 4 XC1, 4 XC2), ids unchanged, in the original order; for a node at JMC 648e9c8. Their needok C3E exports are in brain18-tf.rows: run on the same node as those exports' records or import them.
XCE.tikv-txn.impl_X2_0_0_1_bag.w1.cinf 250 8640000 env JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS=-Xmx32g "$DAAVAR"/scripts/jmc-run.sh cf-tikv-txn 'bench.tikv.TxnKv:impl,X2,0,0,1,bag' must 0 1 export.jsonl 8640000
XCE.tikv-txn.impl_X2_0_0_1_fifo.w1.cinf 250 8640000 env JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS=-Xmx32g "$DAAVAR"/scripts/jmc-run.sh cf-tikv-txn 'bench.tikv.TxnKv:impl,X2,0,0,1,fifo' must 0 1 export.jsonl 8640000
